msgid "Stop and Quit?"
msgstr "要停止並結束嗎？"

#: src/window.py:960
msgid ""
"A device is being restored. Interrupting now can leave it unusable until it "
"is restored again."
msgstr "正在還原裝置。現在中斷可能會導致裝置無法使用，直到再次還原。"

#: src/window.py:963
